WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.463
Hey, Little Boy.

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:08.675
ARCAM is so weak,
I'm about to fall asleep.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:10.760
It's not their fault, Fatman.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:15.306
They think they can fight our assassin
squad with their pathetic equipment.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.017
Such fools.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:21.271
You bastard!

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.897
You came…

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.190
Spriggan!

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.443
Yu Ominae!

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:30.405
Y-Yu!

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:36.870
You bastards.

00:00:37.495 --> 00:00:40.331
You want the Ark so badly
you would do this?

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.750
Want?

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:43.710
No.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:49.799
A powerful relic like Noah should be
kept under the United States' watch.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:54.345
That's why we delivered
this righteous retribution!

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:59.225
Righteous?

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:03.104
Screw you, you bastards.

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:08.610
Don't think you can leave
this mountain in one piece!

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.945
Fool!

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:14.365
We're nothing like Hummingbat!

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.247
You won't be able to defeat me
with attacks like that!

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.638
What's the matter, Spriggan?

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:38.681
Keep running!

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:42.352
A single fragment to the head
and it's instant death!

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.282
Little Boy!

00:01:56.866 --> 00:01:58.284
You punk!

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.289
Don't underestimate me!

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:05.708
Too slow!

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:09.170
You punk!

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.848
This feels like…

00:02:25.728 --> 00:02:28.231
I got you, Spriggan!

00:02:28.857 --> 00:02:31.901
You bastards, those body armors…

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:36.239
That's right, it's Orichalcum like yours!

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:41.161
Don't think that ARCAM has a monopoly
on converting OOPArts into weapons.

00:02:41.744 --> 00:02:46.875
As long as we're wearing the same
body armor, there's no way we can lose!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.211
Kill him, Fatman!

00:02:50.295 --> 00:02:52.130
Break his neck!

00:02:52.213 --> 00:02:54.340
Okay, Little Boy!

